                        </div>

                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                    </div>


                    <div>
                        <span class="history-dot"></span>

                        <div>
                            <strong>PO #DBN-8821</strong>
                            <small>R160,000 • Fulfilled</small>
                        </div>

                        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i>
                    </div>


                    <div>
                        <span class="history-dot"></span>

                        <div>
                            <strong>PO #EC-45821</strong>
                            <small>R300,000 • Current opportunity</small>
                        </div>

                        <span class="history-current">
                            ACTIVE
                        </span>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>


        <!-- RIGHT COPY -->

        <div class="passport-copy">

            <div class="home-section-kicker passport-kicker">
                <span>03</span>
                FULFILMENT PASSPORT
            </div>

            <h2>
                Every successful opportunity
                <span>makes the next one stronger.</span>
            </h2>

            <p>
                VERA doesn't let successful execution disappear
                after settlement. Verified outcomes build credibility for the SME by creating evidence of what an SME
                has actually delivered.
            </p>


            <div class="passport-benefits">

                <div>
                    <i class="bi bi-patch-check"></i>

                    <span>
                        <strong>Verified performance</strong>
                        Build history from real fulfilled opportunities.
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <i class="bi bi-bar-chart"></i>

                    <span>
                        <strong>Demonstrated capacity</strong>
                        Show how the business has grown over time.
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right-circle"></i>

                    <span>
                        <strong>Stronger future applications</strong>
                        Turn successful execution into reusable evidence.
                    </span>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>



